\begin_layout Standard
{In the following, we will present an approach that carries out genetic
 programming on the basis of a program provided by the expert.
 The program will be improved so that it makes the same decisions as the
 black box.
 The changes to the original program should only include the most necessary
 and show the expert the most manageable extensions with which he can improve
 his program.}
