\begin_layout Standard
The goal of GP is to find the one program over many generations that is
 better than all the others.
 To find this program, the population of programs must both promote the
 best programs and create space for new approaches.
 (todo Exploration-exploitation tradeoff?) For this purpose, both the selection
 and the genetic modifications must be chosen accordingly.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
TODO2 Genetic Selection (Tournament Selection)
