In the following, we discuss what the criteria for explainability can be
 and how they can be taken into account in this approach.
 For this purpose, a measure of explainability must be found above all.
 In order to optimize in this respect, the existing possibilities of the
 GP for generating explainable programs are explored and in addition, some
 possible and implemented extensions of GP for even more explainability
 are proposed and discussed.
\end_layout

