\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Fix-nodes must not be affected.
 If 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Expressions should always be reduced in the same way if possible.
 Due to the commutative law, for example, the expression 
\begin_inset Formula $2+a\cdot2$
\end_inset

