 However, it can also be arranged differently, for example as 
\begin_inset Formula $2\cdot a+2$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Reduced expressions must not contain any mathematical illogical bits.
 With the abundance of mathematical simplifications that exist, if all simplific
ations are allowed, many special cases arise.
 These often cannot be evaluated, but even then they are often very unfit
 and in addition often not explainable.
